{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Awaken a dull complexion with Glow-rify, a regal blend engineered to unveil your natural radiance. Skin-brightening Carrot Seed Oil delivers a heavy dose of beta-carotene to stimulate cellular turnover, while pure Lavender calms redness. Wash away fatigue and step into the light with a smooth, beautifully renewed glow.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>Elevate your glow with Glow-rify. A luxurious herbal bar formulated with Goat's Milk, and a skin-brightening blend of Carrot Seed and calming Lavender. A gentle bar that revives dull, tired skin and restores a luminous, youthful complexion. The powerful combination of carrot seed oil and lavender targets uneven skin tone, cellular repair, and deep hydration.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Cellular Regeneration: Carrot seed oil contains high levels of beta-carotene and vitamin A to stimulate healthy cell turnover</li>
                    <li>Intense Brightening: Natural antioxidants visibly fade dark spots hyperpigmentation, and environmental sun damage</li>
                    <li>Anti-Aging Protection: Rich in vitamin E, it combats free radicals to smooth fine lines and improve skin elasticity</li>
                    <li>Soothing &amp; Calming: Pure lavender essential oil reduces redness, balances oil production, and calms acne-prone skin</li>
                    <li>Deep Hydration: The nourishing base locks in moisture without clogging pores, leaving skin plump and glowing</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Dull, tired, or uneven skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Goats Milk, Raw Honey, Organic Glycerin, Carrot Seed Oil, Organic Frankincense Oil, Jasmine Oil, Cypress Oil, Organic Lavender Oil, Geranium Oil, and Natural Preservative.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Work into a rich lather, massage onto skin, and rinse to reveal a bright, youthful complexion.</p></div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-care' %}
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Storage / Safety Disclaimer<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <p><strong>Safety Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of children.</p>
    <p><strong>Aromatherapy &amp; Herbal Note:</strong> This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-shipping' %}
{%- endif -%}
